  "evidence": "The National course retains the full northern outer loop, western main straight and middle eastern hairpin, closing through the short western U-return. The public all-roads snapshot supplies every course section except the short junction from way 645849365 index 55 to way 645849366 index 4. That junction is independently digitized from continuous pavement in the pinned June 18, 2026 image. The southern outer loop, southern oval, northern shortcut and separate eastern karting circuit are excluded. Junction precision is limited to native 10 m imagery; operating direction and final corner placement require review. Native satellite ground resolution is 10 m. Nearest-neighbor rendering does not add resolution. Fine corner alignment and historical direction remain draft; no vertices are fitted to private diagrams, timing positions or nominal distance."
